.

The variation in these figures is due to the fact that 
official Euribor interest rates are calculated and announced once per working day at around 11:00 a.m.
, and the sources may be displaying rates from different dates. The 12-month Euribor is particularly important as 
it is the reference index for millions of variable-rate mortgages in Spain, Italy, Portugal and beyond
.
